# jdot ignore file (tracked example / shared defaults)
#
# Copy to .jdotignore (gitignored) and edit per machine, or edit this
# file directly if you want a shared default committed to the repo.
#
# Two kinds of entries, one per line:
#
# 1. A bare package name skips the whole package during `jdot stow`.
#      vscode
#      zed
#
# 2. A glob (contains / or *) skips matching files within any package,
#    useful for submodule READMEs/LICENSEs you don't want symlinked
#    into $HOME.
#      */README.md
#      */LICENSE
#      skills/*/node_modules
